'''Luck''' is a [[status effect]] found exclusively {{in|Java}} and {{LCE}} that increases the chances of receiving better loot from certain [[loot tables]]. It is opposite to [[Bad Luck]]. The only loot table influenced by luck is fishing.

== Effect ==
Luck adds the effects level to the [[Attribute#Luck|luck attribute]], which affects the results of [[loot table]]s, with a higher attribute value increasing the amount and quality of results.

The number of rolls is increased by the [[Loot table#Pool|pools]] "bonus rolls"-value times this attributes value, rounded down, and the weight of each [[Loot table#Entry|entry]] is increased by its quality times this attributes value, also rounded down.

Quality is currently only used by [[Fishing]].

